{# Theme cycle button — one click steps through clair → sombre → automatique
   (public/assets/js/theme.js, design.md §7.8). Server-rendered with the
   "auto" icon: the real preference lives in the visitor's browser
   (localStorage, functional consent) and theme.js corrects the icon and
   aria-label on load, before the first paint of the button matters.
   Rendered in both nav surfaces (mobile header, desktop bar) via this one
   partial — never copy this markup at a call site. No inline min-height:
   touch sizing lives in app.css's pointer:coarse block (design.md §7.2). #}
<button type="button"
        class="btn btn-link text-body p-2 d-inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center"
        data-theme-toggle
        aria-label="Thème : automatique (cliquer pour changer)"
        title="Thème">
    <i class="bi bi-circle-half fs-5" aria-hidden="true" data-theme-toggle-icon></i>
</button>
